WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.228
Today, each word is the same as the one before, with one letter changed.

2
00:00:04.678 --> 00:00:05.824
Watch how it works.

3
00:00:09.032 --> 00:00:09.995
The word is sat.

4
00:00:13.655 --> 00:00:14.649
The word is sit.

5
00:00:18.138 --> 00:00:19.144
The word is pit.

6
00:00:20.044 --> 00:00:24.023
On the page, cover the word with your finger. Show it one letter at a time.

7
00:00:24.473 --> 00:00:29.535
Your child has to look at every letter. Guessing does not work here, and that is the point.

8
00:00:29.985 --> 00:00:34.875
If they guess, stay calm. Point to the letter that changed, and ask them to look again.

9
00:00:35.325 --> 00:00:40.733
Then read and match. Your child sounds out each word and draws a line to its picture.
